OL,3,GNEWSASix people rescued after yacht
OL,4,Agets tangled in fish farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been rescued after a
OL,7,F46ft yacht got into difficulty off the
OL,8,Fcoast of Northern Ireland.
OL,10,FRed Bay Royal National Lifeboat
OL,11,FInstitution (RNLI) spent seven hours at
OL,12,Fsea in the early hours of Saturday
OL,13,Fmorning off Cushendall, County Antrim.
OL,15,FBelfast Coastguard received a distress
OL,16,Fcall from the boat, which had been
OL,17,Ftravelling from Oban in Scotland to
OL,18,FPortugal.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
