OL,3,GNEWSASix people rescued after yacht
OL,4,Agets tangled in fish farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe yacht lost all power and steering
OL,7,Fafter making contact with a fish farm
OL,8,Fin Red Bay, in 60 knots of wind,
OL,9,Fcausing it to become trapped.
